  "releaseNotes": "Targets .NET 10 (net10.0) instead of .NET 8. Projects on .NET 8 or 9 should stay on 2.0.0.1.\n\t\t\tNo public API changes since 2.0.0.1.\n\t\t\tGovukNotify moves from 7.2.0 to 8.2.0, a major version. GovukNotify 8 drops .NET 9 and earlier and updates its JWT and Newtonsoft.Json dependencies, with no API changes.\n\t\t\tOther dependency changes: Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection 8.0.0 to 10.0.13 and Xeption 2.8.0 to 2.9.0.\n\t\t\tThe package license changes from MIT to Apache 2.0.",
